.SH ENVIRONMENT
.PP
\fBPREFIX\fR
.RS 4
Overrides the app install prefix.\& Defaults to \fB$HOME/.\&local\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBXDG_DATA_HOME\fR
.RS 4
Overrides the data directory for completions and man pages.\& Defaults to
\fB$HOME/.\&local/share\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBXDG_STATE_HOME\fR
.RS 4
Overrides the state directory for the install manifest.\& Defaults to
\fB$HOME/.\&local/state\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBHOME\fR
.RS 4
Required for user install targets and default XDG paths.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH INSTALLATION
.PP
\fBinstall.\&sh\fR copies the cog app payload into \fB$PREFIX/lib/cog/\fR and creates a
PATH symlink at \fB$PREFIX/bin/cog\fR.\& The installed shim resolves its libraries,
templates, and version file relative to the real app root after following the
symlink.\&
.PP
The installer writes \fB$XDG_STATE_HOME/cog/install-manifest\fR at install time.\&
\fBuninstall.\&sh\fR removes only file paths listed in that manifest and prunes known
cog-owned directories with empty-only \fBrmdir\fR.\& It never recursively removes
Claude or Codex skill and agent roots.\&
.PP
